title: Start
---
// Set character and emotion via metadata
Player: Hello! This is a test. #portrait:Happy #side:Left

// Trigger a cutscene command
<<expression NPC Neutral>>
NPC: I hear you loud and clear. #portrait:Neutral #side:Right

// Play a sound from your SoundRegistry
<<play_audio TestClick>>

// Branching logic
-> This is amazing!
    Player: I'm really impressed. #portrait:Surprised
-> Can we do more?
    Player: What else can this do? #portrait:Thinking

NPC: Endless possibilities!
<<stop_audio>>
